        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis syndon þa domas ðe Ælfred cyncg ⁊ Guðrum cyncg gecuron.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">These are the decrees which King Alfred and King Guthrum enacted.</ab>
